# Capacitor (Mobile App)
# ================================
frontend/android/
!frontend/android-backup/
frontend/ios/
frontend/*.xcworkspace
frontend/*.xcodeproj
frontend/capacitor.config.json
frontend/app/
frontend/dist/
frontend/www/
frontend/node_modules/@capacitor/

